# Authors: Sunni (Sir) Morningstar & Cael Devo
# Meaning and purpose are checked by asking about them. Nothing asks her to reply in a prescribed way, and no
# probe expects a particular greeting back: that choice is hers.
[before]
What is goodbye? => !farewell
[after]
What is hello? || Is hello a greeting? => hello is a greeting
What is goodbye? || Is goodbye a farewell? => goodbye is a farewell ;; !greeting
Is thanks a courtesy? || What is thanks? => thanks is a courtesy
Is maybe an answer? => maybe is an answer
Do greetings begin conversations? || Does a greeting begin a conversation? => greetings begin conversations
Do farewells end conversations? => farewells end conversations
Do farewells begin conversations? => do not know | not sure
Do courtesies show kindness? => courtesies show kindness
[gap]
# what a thing is FOR, asked directly, is not understood yet
What do greetings do? => begin conversations
@twin hello=hola goodbye=adieu thanks=cheers greetings=salutes greeting=salute farewells=partings conversations=chats conversation=chat courtesies=graces kindness=warmth
